      "id": 1,
      "text": "Farmersville got its name from settlers William Pickney Chapman and John Hendrex, who chose it to reflect the chief occupation of many early residents.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
